{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Their portion I have given from My fire-offerings.</b> It gives the reason for <b>you shall not bake chametz</b>: since it is their portion of fire-offerings, it has the legal status of fire-offerings about which it is stated: ״For all leaven and all honey you shall not burn as incense,״ and therefore you shall not bake chametz." "<b>It is holy of holies.</b> It is like one of the most holy offerings." "<b>Like a sin-offering.</b> Just as a sin-offering is from unconsecrated animals, by day, and with the right hand, so too this one."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:15.907807211Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}